","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9088485240936279,"text_excerpt":"We spent an evening at the Higgins for a family anniversary dinner. I was stunned - it was like walking into a spectacular art deco showcase from a bygone era. The lobby is breathtaking, but the detail work throughout the hotel is amazing - whoever designed and built this thing should have won some serious awards. If I were coming in from out of town, this would be where I would stay. The dining experience was terrific - food, service, ambiance. And, important to me, the cocktail program is strong. Highly recommended. As soon as the world returns to a semblance of normalcy, this will be a staycation."},{"business_id":"k_-2RlfuhX4Jl9OaJaSO9w","review_id":"2AMlTkkOe8t8VPqso64oEw","date":"2020-12-15T01:10:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9045673608779907,"text_excerpt":"Hands down the best stay I've ever had in a hotel! I live near the city but decided to take a staycation for the weekend and booked the corner King deluxe room. I had an issue with my first room but the front desk staff were very accommodating and moved me to a perfect replacement. The views of downtown from the room and the bathroom were great. I thought I would hear street noise at night but nothing. It was very serene. The TV was great for viewing and I had the best night's sleep I'd had in a while. I went up to the rooftop bar, Rosie's on the Roof, and had a nice view of the city and great cocktails. 10/10"},{"business_id":"k_-2RlfuhX4Jl9OaJaSO9w","review_id":"2qNBV4KnVCr4hdWn5DCBzw","date":"2021-03-25T00:33:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.895077109336853,"text_excerpt":"You typically won't find me giving too many places a five star review ,but here we are. I was here due to a yelp elite event, and I wasn't too sure what to expect to be honest hence this being my first one. But when I tell you I was blown away when I entered the establishment. We had a rooftop view you which was to die for, One major perk of the event was that you got two complementary cocktails and an appetizer on the house. I went ahead and got the stuffed crab beignets and washed it down with a gin and sprite. Sounds good right? It was exactly what I thought it would be. The manager was very nice along with the serving staff. Would definitely recommend checking them out"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"k_-2RlfuhX4Jl9OaJaSO9w","photo_id":"6exxV-TnQABbSVDm9d7GoA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6exxV-TnQABbSVDm9d7GoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9225619435310364},{"business_id":"k_-2RlfuhX4Jl9OaJaSO9w","photo_id":"HXVJaqEtIrAm3d14dnxc_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HXVJaqEtIrAm3d14dnxc_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9214916229248047},{"business_id":"k_-2RlfuhX4Jl9OaJaSO9w","photo_id":"vBbfNYeofFBz8H0ILIPnQg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/vBbfNYeofFBz8H0ILIPnQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8469168543815613}]},"notebook_case":null}
